 const poss=['fieldGoalsAttempted','offensiveRebounds','turnovers','freeThrowsAttempted'].every(k=>m[k]!=null)?m.fieldGoalsAttempted-m.offensiveRebounds+m.turnovers+.475*m.freeThrowsAttempted:null;
 const rebOpp=m.rebounds!=null&&m.reboundsDifferential!=null?m.rebounds-m.reboundsDifferential:null;
 const metrics=[['PPG',m.avgPoints],['PPG Allowed',ratio(oppPoints,gp)],['OFF Rating',ratio(m.points,poss,100)],['DEF Rating',ratio(oppPoints,poss,100)],['Points in the Paint',m.avgPointsInPaint??ratio(m.pointsInPaint,gp)],['Points in the Paint Allowed',ratio(m.opponentPointsInPaint,gp)],['FG%',m.fieldGoalPct],['eFG%',ratio(m.fieldGoalsMade+.5*m.threePointFieldGoalsMade,m.fieldGoalsAttempted,100)],['2P%',m.twoPointFieldGoalPct??ratio(m.fieldGoalsMade!=null&&m.threePointFieldGoalsMade!=null?m.fieldGoalsMade-m.threePointFieldGoalsMade:null,m.fieldGoalsAttempted!=null&&m.threePointFieldGoalsAttempted!=null?m.fieldGoalsAttempted-m.threePointFieldGoalsAttempted:null,100)],['3P%',m.threePointFieldGoalPct],['3P Rate',ratio(m.threePointFieldGoalsAttempted,m.fieldGoalsAttempted,100)],['3P Rate Allowed',ratio(m.opponentThreePointFieldGoalsAttempted,m.opponentFieldGoalsAttempted,100)],['FT%',m.freeThrowPct],['FT Attempt Rate',ratio(m.freeThrowsAttempted,m.fieldGoalsAttempted,100)],['REB/G',m.avgRebounds],['Rebounds Allowed/Game',ratio(rebOpp,gp)],['Total Rebound Rate',ratio(m.rebounds,m.rebounds!=null&&rebOpp!=null?m.rebounds+rebOpp:null,100)],['AST/G',m.avgAssists],['TOV/G',m.avgTurnovers],['Turnover Margin',m.opponentTurnovers!=null&&m.turnovers!=null?ratio(m.opponentTurnovers-m.turnovers,gp):null],['Pace (est.)',ratio(poss,gp)],['STL/G',m.avgSteals],['BLK/G',m.avgBlocks]];
